---
// Скрытая страница: макет демо-проекта «Кофейня Зерно» (1200×900).
// Скриншот сохраняется в public/portfolio/landing-coffee-shop.webp.
// Это демонстрационная работа: при добавлении первой реальной карточки
// запись с example: true в src/data/projects.json удаляется вместе с превью.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=1200" />
    <title>Demo — Кофейня «Зерно»</title>
    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Manrope Variable";
        src: url("/fonts/manrope-cyrillic-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
        font-weight: 200 800;
        font-display: block;
        unicode-range: U+0301, U+0400-045F, U+0490-0491, U+04B0-04B1, U+2116;
      }
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Manrope Variable";
        src: url("/fonts/manrope-latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
        font-weight: 200 800;
        font-display: block;
        unicode-range:
          U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308,
          U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
      }
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Manrope Variable";
        src: url("/fonts/manrope-latin-ext-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
        font-weight: 200 800;
        font-display: block;
        unicode-range:
          U+0100-02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329,
          U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C0, U+2113,
          U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #0b0b0b;
      }
      .stage {
        position: relative;
        width: 1200px;
        height: 900px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #0b0b0b;
        color: #f5f5f5;
        font-family: "Manrope Variable", Inter, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
      }
      .grain {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 22px 22px;
        opacity: 0.35;
      }
      .nav {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 34px 64px 0;
      }
      .logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .logo .dot {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .logo .dot svg {
        width: 15px;
        height: 15px;
        fill: #f5f5f5;
      }
      .links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 34px;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #a3a3a3;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .cta {
        height: 42px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 24px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        color: #0a0a0a;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .hero {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 58px 64px 0;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        height: 34px;
        padding: 0 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #a3a3a3;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 26px 0 0;
        font-size: 64px;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.02;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }
      .sub {
        margin: 22px 0 0;
        max-width: 430px;
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #a3a3a3;
      }
      .buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 34px;
      }
      .btn-ghost {
        height: 52px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 28px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #f5f5f5;
      }
      .cup {
        position: relative;
        height: 380px;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        background:
          radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), transparent 70%),
          linear-gradient(160deg, #141414, #0a0a0a);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .cup .steam {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 90px;
        width: 2px;
        height: 120px;
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), transparent);
      }
      .cup .ring {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 240px;
        height: 240px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      }
      .cup .ring::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 26px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09), transparent);
      }
      .cup svg.cup-star {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      }
      .cards {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 44px 64px 0;
      }
      .card {
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: #111111;
        padding: 26px;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }
      .card .ic {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .card .ic svg {
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      }
      .card h3 {
        margin: 18px 0 8px;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #a3a3a3;
      }
      .strip {
        position: absolute;
        left: 64px;
        right: 64px;
        bottom: 34px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        padding-top: 26px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #8a8a8a;
      }
      .strip .pill {
        height: 38px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 20px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        color: #f5f5f5;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <header class="nav">
        <div class="logo">
          <span class="dot">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64">
              <path d="M32 4 C33.3 18 37.6 25.2 43.6 28.5 C49.6 31.8 56.3 32 62 32 C56.3 32 49.6 32.2 43.6 35.5 C37.6 38.8 33.3 46 32 60 C30.7 46 26.4 38.8 20.4 35.5 C14.4 32.2 7.7 32 2 32 C7.7 32 14.4 31.8 20.4 28.5 C26.4 25.2 30.7 18 32 4 Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          Зерно
        </div>
        <nav class="links">
          <span>Меню</span>
          <span>О нас</span>
          <span>Контакты</span>
        </nav>
        <span class="cta">Забронировать</span>
      </header>

      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Кофейня на углу</span>
          <h1>Кофе, ради которого возвращаются.</h1>
          <p class="sub">
            Обжарка по вторникам, десерты из своей пекарни и столики у окна. Бронируйте — держим до
            19:00.
          </p>
          <div class="buttons">
            <span class="cta">Забронировать столик</span>
            <span class="btn-ghost">Смотреть меню</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cup" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="steam"></div>
          <div class="ring"></div>
          <svg class="cup-star" viewBox="0 0 64 64">
            <path d="M32 4 C33.3 18 37.6 25.2 43.6 28.5 C49.6 31.8 56.3 32 62 32 C56.3 32 49.6 32.2 43.6 35.5 C37.6 38.8 33.3 46 32 60 C30.7 46 26.4 38.8 20.4 35.5 C14.4 32.2 7.7 32 2 32 C7.7 32 14.4 31.8 20.4 28.5 C26.4 25.2 30.7 18 32 4 Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2 4 6v12l8 4 8-4V6l-8-4Zm0 2.2 6 3v11.6l-6 3-6-3V7.2l6-3Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Своя обжарка</h3>
          <p>Зерно месяца — Эфиопия, нота чернослива и какао.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M4 4h16v4H4V4Zm0 6h16v4H4v-4Zm0 6h16v4H4v-4Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Меню дня</h3>
          <p>Круассаны и тарты из пекарни, пока не разобрали.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 21s-7-4.6-7-10a7 7 0 1 1 14 0c0 5.4-7 10-7 10Zm0-7.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 0 12 6a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0 7.5Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Столики у окна</h3>
          <p>Тихий зал, розетки и вид на бульвар.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="strip">
        <span>Пн–Вс · 8:00–22:00</span>
        <span class="pill">Свайп для брони</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
